(1) Governance: This refers to the governance structure and internal rules that it uses to manage and oversee sustainability-related impacts, risks, and opportunities;

(2) Strategy: This refers to the planning, tactics, and methods it uses to address the sustainability-related impacts, risks, and opportunities;

